From 3797430a2a524d1b7ae7db00818d350a4993e83e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SWG Local Dev <swg-local@localhost>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:41:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Agent body: one move deadline, no walking while down, survey,
 indoor look

Fixes ChatGPT C4 review findings:
- F1: one deadline for the whole move (planning, every leg, every re-plan),
  capped at 95 s so the MCP's 100 s wait never expires first. Test galaxy:
  a 20 s move toward a 1.9 km target returned "timeout" in time and the next
  command answered at once.
- F2: a shared immobileReason() check before and during straight and path
  walking. Test galaxy (helper on): move while incapacitated -> "cannot move
  while incapacitated"; while dead -> "cannot move while dead".
Also:
- helper replies are matched to their request (late answers ignored);
- survey: ResourceListForSurveyMessage -> survey_resources event,
  SurveyMessage -> survey_results (grid + best point). Test galaxy: tool
  range SUI, resource list, survey, sample -> Iron container + XP;
- indoor look: our cell also comes from containment (login inside a building);
- a new scene (login, zone change) clears the old scene's objects, fixing a
  stale tutorial-room container that blanked look outdoors.

Agent: Claude
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
